sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Admin / Platform Operator
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Reconciler as MLflowReconciler<br/>Go Operator
    participant Helm as HelmRenderer<br/>(in-process)
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as data-science-gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant MLflow as MLflow Server<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP TLS
    participant S3 as Artifact Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Admin,Helm: Flow 1: MLflow CR Reconciliation
        Admin->>K8sAPI: Create/Update MLflow CR
        K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Watch event (TLS 1.2+, SA token)
        Reconciler->>Helm: Render embedded Helm chart
        Helm-->>Reconciler: Rendered manifests (Deployment, Service, NetworkPolicy, SA, RBAC, PVC, CronJob)
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Server-Side Apply manifests<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create HTTPRoute<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
        K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Resources created/updated
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over Client,S3: Flow 2: MLflow Server Traffic (RHOAI 3.x)
        Client->>Gateway: HTTPS/443<br/>TLS 1.2+, Platform auth
        Gateway->>MLflow: HTTPS/8443 (via HTTPRoute)<br/>TLS (service-ca cert), K8s auth token
        MLflow->>DB: PostgreSQL/5432<br/>TLS (PGSSLMODE), Connection string
        MLflow->>S3: HTTPS/443 or 9000<br/>TLS 1.2+, AWS IAM / credentials
        S3-->>MLflow: Artifact data
        DB-->>MLflow: Query results
        MLflow-->>Gateway: Response
        Gateway-->>Client: JSON Response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over Reconciler,DB: Flow 3: Database Migration
        Reconciler->>Reconciler: Detect migration needed<br/>(version mismatch)
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Scale Deployment to 0 replicas<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
        K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Deployment scaled
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create migration Job<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
        Note over K8sAPI,DB: Migration Job runs db-migrate container
        K8sAPI->>DB: Run migrations<br/>PostgreSQL/5432, TLS, Connection string
        DB-->>K8sAPI: Migrations complete
        K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Job succeeded (exit code 0)
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Restore Deployment replicas<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
        K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Deployment scaled up
    end
